{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/gnustoactors"]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Daemons that make an NPC wander, tag along, or go through your pockets.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors"},"sections":[],"metadata":{"externalID":"GnustoActors","symbolKind":"module","modules":[{"name":"GnustoActors"}],"roleHeading":"Framework","role":"collection","title":"GnustoActors"},"topicSections":[{"title":"The plugin","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors","doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/init()"],"anchor":"The-plugin"},{"title":"Moving an actor","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/roams(_:named:rooms:chancePerTurn:when:arrival:departure:)","doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/follows(_:named:rooms:when:arrivals:)"],"anchor":"Moving-an-actor"},{"title":"Taking things","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/steals(_:named:candidates:chancePerTurn:announcement:)"],"anchor":"Taking-things"},{"title":"Answering the player","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/reaction(of:for:reply:)"],"anchor":"Answering-the-player"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"An actor who stands where the author put him is scenery with a name on it. Four","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"factories here cover the behaviors that make one feel like a person in the room:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"he moves around a set of rooms on his own, he keeps up with the player, he takes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"things, and he has something to say when spoken to.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GamePlugin"},{"type":"text","text":", which here means it owns nothing at all —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no entities, no "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Global"},{"type":"text","text":", no saved state. An actor’s position "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"is"}]},{"type":"text","text":" his"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"placement, which the engine already saves. So the plugin is never listed in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"content"},{"type":"text","text":"; it is stored as a plain property, and the host splices the return"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"values into its own blocks. The three daemon factories return a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TimedEvent"},{"type":"text","text":" for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"timers"},{"type":"text","text":" block; "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/reaction(of:for:reply:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" returns "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Rules"},{"type":"text","text":" for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"rules"},{"type":"text","text":" block. Everything they act on — the actor, the room set, the loot,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the prose — is handed in by the host."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Randomness is drawn only after a factory’s guards pass. A roaming daemon whose","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"actor is out of position, or a thief whose player has nothing worth taking,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"consumes no randomness at all, so a seeded transcript that never meets the actor","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stays stable no matter what he gets up to elsewhere. ","type":"text"},{"code":"when:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/roams(_:named:rooms:chancePerTurn:when:arrival:departure:)","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/follows(_:named:rooms:when:arrivals:)"},{"type":"text","text":" is evaluated"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"before the position guard for the same reason: a shut gate is a quiet, draw-free"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"turn."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"None of these daemons acts for an actor whose ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Actor.isUnconscious"},{"text":" is set. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"man lying on the floor does not wander off, catch you up, or lift anything out of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"your hands, and he draws no randomness deciding not to. The flag is the engine’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rather than this plugin’s because what usually puts a villain down is a combat","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"plugin, and two plugins cannot see each other: ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GnustoMeleeCombat"},{"text":" sets it and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"this one reads it, with neither library knowing the other exists.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Wiring","text":"Wiring"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import Gnusto","import GnustoActors","","struct Gallery: Game {","    let title = \"Gallery\"","    let actors = ActorBehaviors()","","    let thief = Actor { name(\"shadowy figure\"); synonyms(\"thief\", \"figure\") }","    let painting = Item { name(\"oil painting\"); adjectives(\"oil\") }","    let cellar = Location { name(\"Cellar\"); description(\"…\") }","    let studio = Location { name(\"Studio\"); description(\"…\") }","","    var timers: [TimedEvent] {","        actors.roams(","            thief,","            named: \"thief.roam\",","            rooms: [cellar, studio],","            chancePerTurn: 50,","            arrival: \"A shadow detaches itself from the doorway.\",","            departure: \"The shadow is somewhere else, and you did not see it go.\")","        actors.steals(","            thief,","            named: \"thief.steal\",","            candidates: [painting],","            chancePerTurn: 30,","            announcement: .naming { \"A hand you never see relieves you of \\($0).\" })","    }","","    var rules: Rules {","        actors.reaction(of: thief, for: [.give, .attack], reply: \"The figure is not there when you reach it.\")","    }","","    var map: WorldMap { … }","}"]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Roaming-and-following-are-different-daemons","text":"Roaming and following are different daemons"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/roams(_:named:rooms:chancePerTurn:when:arrival:departure:)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"teleports the actor within a room set, with no exit-graph awareness — a wall"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"between two rooms in the set will not stop him. It has both an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"arrival"},{"type":"text","text":" and a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"departure"},{"type":"text","text":" line, because the player can be standing in either room."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/follows(_:named:rooms:when:arrivals:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" moves the actor to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"wherever the player now stands. Daemons tick at the end of the turn, after ","type":"text"},{"code":"go","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"has resolved and the new room has been described, so the companion catches up on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the same turn and his arrival line trails the room description. There is no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"departure","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" line, because he only ever moves ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"toward","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" the player and nobody is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"left behind to watch him go. He draws no randomness whatever: ","type":"text"},{"code":"arrivals","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"cycled by the saved turn counter, so the line varies from arrival to arrival and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stays identical across a save and restore. Pass one line for a fixed","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"announcement, or a dozen so a constant companion does not wear his welcome out.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Both prose channels are gated on light. In the dark, or a room away, the movement","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is silent.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Two ways to scope a follower, and they scope different things. ","type":"text"},{"code":"rooms:","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is a","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whitelist of "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"destinations"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" — a gaoler who walks the corridors and will not set"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"foot in a cell follows you along the one and lets you go into the other, which is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what makes “somewhere he will not go” a place you can stand. "},{"code":"when:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"gate, for the companion who has been told to wait. "},{"code":"stopDaemon(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" parks him"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"where he stands and "},{"code":"startDaemon(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" picks him up again; "},{"code":"Sources\/KindlyDeep\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"turns its whole endgame on which room the mule was standing in when he was"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"parked."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Start a follower co-located with the player and there is no spurious arrival on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"turn one.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"The thief takes from anywhere in the room","anchor":"The-thief-takes-from-anywhere-in-the-room","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/steals(_:named:candidates:chancePerTurn:announcement:)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lifts a candidate from wherever it lies in the shared room: out of the player’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"hands, off the floor, or from inside anything open, to any depth. Only another"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"actor’s hands are out of reach. The theft is announced only when the room is lit;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"in the dark you find out when you check your pockets.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Worked-examples","type":"heading","text":"Worked examples"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sources\/Lighthouse\/"},{"type":"text","text":" has a keeper who roams two rooms stacked on a staircase."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sources\/KindlyDeep\/"},{"type":"text","text":" has the follow-park-rejoin cycle in full, and its design"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doc ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"docs\/games\/kindly-deep.md"},{"type":"text","text":") is where the reasoning lives."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sources\/Zork1\/"},{"type":"text","text":" runs the thief: roaming the whole underground, stealing from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"treasure roster, and fighting back only in his own lair."}]}]}],"references":{"doc://GnustoActors/documentation/GnustoActors/ActorBehaviors/roams(_:named:rooms:chancePerTurn:when:arrival:departure:)":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoactors\/actorbehaviors\/roams(_:named:rooms:chanceperturn:when:arrival:departure:)","abstract":[{"text":"A daemon that, with ","type":"text"},{"code":"chancePerTurn","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", moves ","type":"text"},{"code":"actor","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to a random","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"other","type":"text"}]},{"text":" room in ","type":"text"},{"code":"rooms","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — a teleport within the set, with no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"exit-graph awareness (a wall between two rooms in the set won’t","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stop him). Arrival\/departure lines print only when the player’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"room is lit and is the room being entered or left: in the dark, or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a room away, movement is silent. The daemon idles (no RNG drawn)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"while the actor is outside ","type":"text"},{"code":"rooms","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — including after ","type":"text"},{"code":"vanish()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"but the host should still ","type":"text"},{"code":"stopDaemon(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" on the actor’s death.","type":"text"}],"title":"roams(_:named:rooms:chancePerTurn:when:arrival:departure:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"roams","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5ActorV","text":"Actor","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"named"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"rooms"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8LocationV","text":"Location"},{"kind":"text","text":"], "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"chancePerTurn"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"when"},{"kind":"text","text":": () -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"arrival"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"departure"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"?) -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TimedEventV","text":"TimedEvent"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/roams(_:named:rooms:chancePerTurn:when:arrival:departure:)"},"doc://GnustoActors/documentation/GnustoActors/ActorBehaviors/reaction(of:for:reply:)":{"abstract":[{"text":"A canned reply when any of the named intents target the actor —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"“talk to troll”, “give sword to troll”, whatever the host’s verbs","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"emit. One line, before-phase, ends the turn."}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoactors\/actorbehaviors\/reaction(of:for:reply:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/reaction(of:for:reply:)","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"reaction(of:for:reply:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"reaction"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"of"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5ActorV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Actor"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"for"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto6IntentV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Intent"},{"kind":"text","text":"], "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"reply"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5RulesV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Rules"}]},"doc://GnustoActors/documentation/GnustoActors":{"title":"GnustoActors","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Daemons that make an NPC wander, tag along, or go through your pockets."}],"role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoactors","type":"topic"},"doc://GnustoActors/documentation/GnustoActors/ActorBehaviors":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ActorBehaviors"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoactors\/actorbehaviors","title":"ActorBehaviors","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Logic-only NPC behaviors: roaming, theft, canned reactions. The plugin"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"owns no entities and no state — position ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"is","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" the actor’s placement —","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"so the host declares its actors and splices these factories into its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"own "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"timers"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"rules","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" blocks:"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ActorBehaviors"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors"},"doc://GnustoActors/documentation/GnustoActors/ActorBehaviors/follows(_:named:rooms:when:arrivals:)":{"abstract":[{"text":"A daemon that keeps ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"actor"},{"text":" in the player’s room: each turn, if the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"actor is onstage but elsewhere, it teleports to wherever the player","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"now stands. Daemons tick at the end of the turn, after the player’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"go"},{"text":" has resolved and the new room is described, so the companion","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"catches up the same turn and its ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"arrival"},{"text":" line trails the room","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"description. The line prints only when the destination is lit: in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the dark the companion arrives unseen. There is deliberately no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"departure"},{"text":" line — the companion only ever moves ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"to"}]},{"text":" the player,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so no one is ever in the room it leaves to watch it go (unlike","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"roams"},{"text":"). The daemon idles while the actor is offstage — including","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"after ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vanish()"},{"text":" — and the host may ","type":"text"},{"code":"stopDaemon(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to park the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"companion for a “wait here” beat, then "},{"code":"startDaemon(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to resume."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It draws no randomness at all (unlike "},{"code":"roams","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"steals","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"following companion never perturbs the seeded stream: "},{"code":"arrivals","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cycled by the saved turn counter, so the line varies from arrival to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"arrival yet stays deterministic across save and restore. Pass one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"line for a fixed announcement, a dozen so a constant companion does"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not wear his welcome out. Start the companion co-located with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"player ("},{"code":"starts(in:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" the player’s start room) to avoid a spurious"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"arrival on turn one."}],"title":"follows(_:named:rooms:when:arrivals:)","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"follows"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5ActorV","text":"Actor"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"named","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rooms","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Location","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8LocationV"},{"text":"]?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"when","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": () -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"arrivals","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"]) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TimedEvent","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TimedEventV"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/follows(_:named:rooms:when:arrivals:)","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoactors\/actorbehaviors\/follows(_:named:rooms:when:arrivals:)"},"doc://GnustoActors/documentation/GnustoActors/ActorBehaviors/init()":{"abstract":[{"text":"Creates the plugin.","type":"text"}],"title":"init()","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"()"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/init()","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoactors\/actorbehaviors\/init()"},"doc://GnustoActors/documentation/GnustoActors/ActorBehaviors/steals(_:named:candidates:chancePerTurn:announcement:)":{"kind":"symbol","title":"steals(_:named:candidates:chancePerTurn:announcement:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoActors\/documentation\/GnustoActors\/ActorBehaviors\/steals(_:named:candidates:chancePerTurn:announcement:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A daemon that, when "},{"code":"actor","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" shares the player’s room, rolls"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"chancePerTurn"},{"type":"text","text":" and moves one random "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"reachable","type":"text"}]},{"text":" item from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"candidates"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"into the actor’s inventory, announcing it with the stolen item’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rendered name — “the silver chalice”, “Ozymandias” — so the line writes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"no article of its own.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Like the original’s thief, the actor lifts a candidate from wherever it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lies in the shared room: out of the player’s hands, off the floor, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from inside anything open — a sack, a trophy case, a table top — to any"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"depth. Only another actor’s hands are beyond reach. The theft is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"announced only when the player’s room is lit: in the dark you find out"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"when you check your pockets.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/gnustoactors\/actorbehaviors\/steals(_:named:candidates:chanceperturn:announcement:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"steals","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"Actor","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5ActorV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"named","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"candidates"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"Item","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto4ItemV"},{"text":"], ","kind":"text"},{"text":"chancePerTurn","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"announcement","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"GameText","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV4LineV","text":"Line"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"text":"GameText","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto8GameTextV4NounV","text":"Noun","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">) -> ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"TimedEvent","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TimedEventV"}]}}}